  "title": "Human Rights Due Diligence in Canada",
  "summary": "Recognizing that Human Rights risks can arise in any jurisdiction, in 2025, Gran Tierra Energy extended its Human Rights due diligence approach to Canada through a Risk Assessment conducted with Shift–an independent, non-profit centre of expertise on the United Nations Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights. The assessment included site visits, interviews with employees […]",
